		(uuid "53d46e45-f720-56d9-ae86-c6eceb00a3ae")
	)
	(text "AI-MCUTOOL  /  ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8\nWi-Fi控制 · 五路按键 · 电源切换 · 充电插拔 · 电池测量 · 四路电压 · 3.3V UART"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5ea34ae2-fc98-56c4-a538-10ec1420e8c8")
	)
	(text "CHG_IN → DUT_CHG\n独立5V充电器输入\n共源背靠背P-MOS\n无主动放电；真实电池模式验证"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 31 161 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "68881e44-c4e6-50f3-b8ef-2a2f112d5b02")
	)
	(text "外部电池 / 模拟电源 / 充电器各自独立；工具自身仅使用5V供电。\n双击功能框进入图页。跨页接口使用命名端口；同页功能电路优先直接连线。\n当前为原理图设计，未做PCB、样机或整机额定能力验收。"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 245 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b369e784-8b0e-5f83-8a4c-9404e6165ceb")
	)
	(text "DC / Type-C：仅5V\nLM66100双入口隔离\nLDL1117输出3.3V\n输出：TOOL_3V3 / COMMON_GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 31 61 0)
		(effects
